---
title: Inbox Settings
description: >-
  Configure Inbox Settings in Taskip to manage business emails, enable auto
  replies, create quick responses, set signatures, and centralize all
  communication in one workspace inbox.
sidebar:
  order: 2
---
Inbox Settings in Taskip allows users to configure and manage their **Business Inbox**, enabling centralized email communication within the workspace.

It provides tools for organizing emails, automating responses, and managing sender identity.

## Purpose

- Centralize all email conversations
- Connect external email accounts via forwarding
- Automate responses to incoming emails
- Improve response speed using templates
- Maintain consistent email branding

## Business Inbox

### Description

The Business Inbox allows you to connect your existing email accounts to a unique workspace email address.

### Workspace Email Address

Each workspace is assigned a dedicated inbox address:

**Example:**\
[business@my-agency.taskip.email](mailto:business@my-agency.taskip.email)

### Functionality

- Receive emails directly into Taskip
- Send emails from connected inbox
- Manage all communication in one place
- Support multiple email aliases

## General Settings

### Tags

#### Description

Tags are used to categorize and organize emails for better management.

### Default Tags

- Duplicate
- Replied
- OnHold
- Important
- Spam
- High
- Medium
- Low
- Urgent

### Add New Tag

#### Function

Create custom tags based on workflow needs.

#### Example

- Sales Lead
- Support Request
- Follow Up

## Auto Reply

### Description

Automatically send responses to incoming emails.

### Configuration

{% table %}
- Field
- Type
- Description
---
- Enable Auto Reply
- Boolean
- Turns auto reply on/off
{% /table %}

### Behavior

- When enabled, system sends predefined response to all incoming emails
- Useful for acknowledgment or support responses

### Use Cases

- Customer support acknowledgment
- Out-of-office replies
- Lead confirmation messages

## Quick Response

### Description

Quick Replies allow you to save reusable responses for faster communication.

### Features

- Create predefined message templates
- Insert replies instantly while responding
- Reduce manual typing

### Add Quick Reply

#### Example

- “Thank you for reaching out. We will get back to you shortly.”
- “Please share more details about your request.”

## 7. Email Signatures

### Description

Email Signatures define how your outgoing emails appear to recipients.

### Configuration

{% table %}
- Field
- Description
---
- Connected Email
- Email address used for sending
---
- Signature Preview
- Displays current signature
{% /table %}

### Example Signature

```
Best regards,
Khairul Bashar
Taskip Team
hi@khairulbashar.com

```

### Behavior

- Automatically appended to outgoing emails
- Ensures consistent branding and identity

## 8. Inbox Address Configuration

### Description

Each workspace is assigned a unique inbox address for receiving emails.

### Example

[business@my-agency.taskip.email](mailto:business@my-agency.taskip.email)

### Functionality

- Receive emails via forwarding
- Centralize multiple inboxes
- Manage all communications in one place

## Connect Business Email

### Description

Allows integration of external email accounts using forwarding.

### Setup Process

1. Copy your workspace inbox address
1. Go to your email provider (e.g. Gmail, Outlook)
1. Set up email forwarding to Taskip inbox address
1. Save settings

### Features

- Receive emails in Taskip
- Connect multiple email aliases
- Manage conversations centrally

## System Behavior

- All forwarded emails appear in Inbox
- Tags help categorize emails automatically or manually
- Auto reply triggers on incoming messages (if enabled)
- Quick replies can be used during response
- Signatures are appended to outgoing emails

## Best Practices

- Use tags to organize emails efficiently
- Enable auto reply for support or lead capture
- Create standard quick replies for common queries
- Set professional email signatures
- Connect all business emails for centralized management

## Summary

Inbox Settings in Taskip provides a complete system for managing business email communication. It enables centralized inbox management, automation, categorization, and consistent branding, ensuring efficient and scalable communication workflows.
